  },
  "description": "Draft feedback about an observed bug, blocked task, confusing behavior, or concrete improvement idea in this application. Confirm with the user before transmitting. Describe only evidence available from the current task; do not invent failures, repeat an existing report, or include credentials or personal data. Do not use for unrelated requests or hypothetical problems. A draft is not proof of submission; only a success receipt confirms acceptance.",
